भक्तिं मयि परां कृत्वा मामेवैष्यत्यसंशय: ॥ ६८ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4839,\"bb\":4233,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/68/b4233/\",\"body_value\":\"ya idaṁ paramaṁ guhyaṁ
mad-bhakteṣv abhidhāsyati
bhaktiṁ mayi parāṁ kṛtvā
mām evaiṣyaty asaṁśayaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4840,\"bb\":4234,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/68/b4234/\",\"shadow_value\":\"yaḥ – anyone who; idam – this; paramam – most; guhyam – confidential secret; mat – of Mine; bhakteṣu – amongst devotees; abhidhāsyati – explains; bhaktim – devotional service; mayi – unto Me; parām – transcendental; kṛtvā – doing; mām – unto Me; eva – certainly; eṣyati – comes; asaṁśayaḥ – without doubt.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"yaḥ\",\"translation\":\"anyone who\"},{\"word\":\"idam\",\"translation\":\"this\"},{\"word\":\"paramam\",\"translation\":\"most\"},{\"word\":\"guhyam\",\"translation\":\"confidential secret\"},{\"word\":\"mat\",\"translation\":\"of Mine\"},{\"word\":\"bhakteṣu\",\"translation\":\"amongst devotees\"},{\"word\":\"abhidhāsyati\",\"translation\":\"explains\"},{\"word\":\"bhaktim\",\"translation\":\"devotional service\"},{\"word\":\"mayi\",\"translation\":\"unto Me\"},{\"word\":\"parām\",\"translation\":\"transcendental\"},{\"word\":\"kṛtvā\",\"translation\":\"doing\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"unto Me\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"eṣyati\",\"translation\":\"comes\"},{\"word\":\"asaṁśayaḥ\",\"translation\":\"without doubt\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4841,\"bb\":4235,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/68/b4235/\",\"body_value\":\"For one who explains this supreme secret to the devotees, pure devotional service is guaranteed, and at the end he will come back to Me.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4842,\"bb\":4236,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/68/b4236/\",\"body_value\":\"Generally it is advised that Bhagavad-gītā be discussed amongst the devotees only, for those who are not devotees will understand neither Kṛṣṇa nor Bhagavad-gītā. Those who do not accept Kṛṣṇa as He is and Bhagavad-gītā as it is should not try to explain Bhagavad-gītā whimsically and become offenders. Bhagavad-gītā should be explained to persons who are ready to accept Kṛṣṇa as the Supreme Personality of Godhead. It is a subject matter for the devotees only and not for philosophical speculators. Anyone, however, who tries sincerely to present Bhagavad-gītā as it is will advance in devotional activities and reach the pure devotional state of life. As a result of such pure devotion, he is sure to go back home, back to Godhead.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 18.68\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 18.68\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",